  "body": "Bonded (Archivist's Lens). Attach to your location. Limit 1 per location.\nAttached location gains: “⭕ When you would draw a card during the investigation phase: Search the top 3 cards of your deck for any card and draw it instead. Shuffle your deck. (Group limit once per round)”\n【Forced】 - At the end of the round, if there are no investigators at attached location: Set Focused Field aside out of play.",
